    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425430/extras/34f8a7585ddf02fe59745c0895e9aca9.poster.avif?t=1751746813\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425430/extras/34f8a7585ddf02fe59745c0895e9aca9.webm?t=1751746813\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425430/extras/34f8a7585ddf02fe59745c0895e9aca9.mp4?t=1751746813\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Dive into a sprawling futuristic metropolis, where towering skyscrapers pierce the skies, neon signs illuminate the night, and every corner hides secrets. From bustling markets to shadowy alleys, explore an open world brimming with danger, adventure, and untold mysteries waiting to be unraveled.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425430/extras/200be2f7568ed2df1d3ac6d89898294f.poster.avif?t=1751746813\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425430/extras/200be2f7568ed2df1d3ac6d89898294f.webm?t=1751746813\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425430/extras/200be2f7568ed2df1d3ac6d89898294f.mp4?t=1751746813\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Experience a living, dynamic world where every character you meet has a story to tell and every street is alive with action. From heated arguments in neon-lit bars to unexpected chases through crowded alleys, the city feels alive, constantly shifting and responding to your choices and actions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425430/extras/8ace5346898fdf815a72ad9856e0be5b.poster.avif?t=1751746813\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425430/extras/8ace5346898fdf815a72ad9856e0be5b.webm?t=1751746813\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425430/extras/8ace5346898fdf815a72ad9856e0be5b.mp4?t=1751746813\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a game that never stands still. With regular updates adding thrilling new missions, expansive locations, and groundbreaking features, there\u2019s always something fresh to explore. Whether it\u2019s uncovering new storylines or discovering enhanced gameplay mechanics, the adventure is ever-evolving.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425430/extras/34f8a7585ddf02fe59745c0895e9aca9.poster.avif?t=1751746813\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425430/extras/34f8a7585ddf02fe59745c0895e9aca9.webm?t=1751746813\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425430/extras/34f8a7585ddf02fe59745c0895e9aca9.mp4?t=1751746813\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Dive into a sprawling futuristic metropolis, where towering skyscrapers pierce the skies, neon signs illuminate the night, and every corner hides secrets. From bustling markets to shadowy alleys, explore an open world brimming with danger, adventure, and untold mysteries waiting to be unraveled.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425430/extras/200be2f7568ed2df1d3ac6d89898294f.poster.avif?t=1751746813\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425430/extras/200be2f7568ed2df1d3ac6d89898294f.webm?t=1751746813\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425430/extras/200be2f7568ed2df1d3ac6d89898294f.mp4?t=1751746813\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Experience a living, dynamic world where every character you meet has a story to tell and every street is alive with action. From heated arguments in neon-lit bars to unexpected chases through crowded alleys, the city feels alive, constantly shifting and responding to your choices and actions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425430/extras/8ace5346898fdf815a72ad9856e0be5b.poster.avif?t=1751746813\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425430/extras/8ace5346898fdf815a72ad9856e0be5b.webm?t=1751746813\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425430/extras/8ace5346898fdf815a72ad9856e0be5b.mp4?t=1751746813\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a game that never stands still. With regular updates adding thrilling new missions, expansive locations, and groundbreaking features, there\u2019s always something fresh to explore. Whether it\u2019s uncovering new storylines or discovering enhanced gameplay mechanics, the adventure is ever-evolving.</p>",
    "short_description": "Dive into a dark cyberpunk world where megacorporations reign and technology merges with humanity. Explore a futuristic megacity, hack systems, fight enemies, and uncover the secrets of digital chaos. Your choices will shape the fate of this world.",
